<item><title>AES ministers review second-year roadmap in Ouagadougou</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/aes-ministers-review-second-year-roadmap-in-ouagadougou-d87e3d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/aes-ministers-review-second-year-roadmap-in-ouagadougou-d87e3d/</guid><category>Burkina Faso</category><description>Ministers from Burkina Faso, Mali and Niger are reviewing progress on the confederation&apos;s roadmap at a two-day session that ends with a synthesis note.</description><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 22:35:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/aes-ministers-review-second-year-roadmap-in-ouagadougou-d87e3d/share.jpg" length="42109" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/aes-ministers-review-second-year-roadmap-in-ouagadougou-d87e3d/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
